{"fps": 30, "frames": 1597, "beats": [{"a": 0, "b": 148, "text": "The father of value investing made his biggest profit breaking his own rule.", "words": [{"w": "The", "f": 8, "e": 14}, {"w": "father", "f": 14, "e": 25}, {"w": "of", "f": 26, "e": 30}, {"w": "value", "f": 31, "e": 41}, {"w": "investing", "f": 41, "e": 57}, {"w": "made", "f": 58, "e": 66}, {"w": "his", "f": 66, "e": 73}, {"w": "biggest", "f": 73, "e": 86}, {"w": "profit", "f": 87, "e": 98}, {"w": "breaking", "f": 98, "e": 113}, {"w": "his", "f": 114, "e": 120}, {"w": "own", "f": 120, "e": 126}, {"w": "rule.", "f": 127, "e": 136}]}, {"a": 148, "b": 269, "text": "It's New York, nineteen forty-eight. You work for Benjamin Graham.", "words": [{"w": "It's", "f": 150, "e": 158}, {"w": "New", "f": 159, "e": 165}, {"w": "York,", "f": 165, "e": 175}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 175, "e": 190}, {"w": "forty-eight.", "f": 190, "e": 212}, {"w": "You", "f": 212, "e": 218}, {"w": "work", "f": 219, "e": 227}, {"w": "for", "f": 227, "e": 233}, {"w": "Benjamin", "f": 234, "e": 248}, {"w": "Graham.", "f": 249, "e": 262}]}, {"a": 269, "b": 370, "text": "His rule: about five percent, tops, in any one stock.", "words": [{"w": "His", "f": 271, "e": 277}, {"w": "rule:", "f": 278, "e": 288}, {"w": "about", "f": 288, "e": 298}, {"w": "five", "f": 298, "e": 306}, {"w": "percent,", "f": 307, "e": 322}, {"w": "tops,", "f": 322, "e": 332}, {"w": "in", "f": 332, "e": 337}, {"w": "any", "f": 337, "e": 344}, {"w": "one", "f": 344, "e": 350}, {"w": "stock.", "f": 351, "e": 362}]}, {"a": 370, "b": 449, "text": "He's so careful, he'd diversify his lunch.", "words": [{"w": "He's", "f": 372, "e": 379}, {"w": "so", "f": 380, "e": 384}, {"w": "careful,", "f": 385, "e": 399}, {"w": "he'd", "f": 399, "e": 407}, {"w": "diversify", "f": 408, "e": 423}, {"w": "his", "f": 424, "e": 430}, {"w": "lunch.", "f": 430, "e": 441}]}, {"a": 449, "b": 526, "text": "Then a small car insurer comes up for sale.", "words": [{"w": "Then", "f": 451, "e": 458}, {"w": "a", "f": 458, "e": 461}, {"w": "small", "f": 461, "e": 470}, {"w": "car", "f": 471, "e": 477}, {"w": "insurer", "f": 477, "e": 489}, {"w": "comes", "f": 490, "e": 499}, {"w": "up", "f": 499, "e": 503}, {"w": "for", "f": 504, "e": 510}, {"w": "sale.", "f": 510, "e": 519}]}, {"a": 526, "b": 627, "text": "It sells by mail to government workers. No agents.", "words": [{"w": "It", "f": 528, "e": 533}, {"w": "sells", "f": 534, "e": 544}, {"w": "by", "f": 545, "e": 549}, {"w": "mail", "f": 550, "e": 559}, {"w": "to", "f": 559, "e": 564}, {"w": "government", "f": 565, "e": 584}, {"w": "workers.", "f": 584, "e": 600}, {"w": "No", "f": 601, "e": 605}, {"w": "agents.", "f": 606, "e": 620}]}, {"a": 627, "b": 742, "text": "Graham buys half of it for seven hundred twelve thousand dollars.", "words": [{"w": "Graham", "f": 629, "e": 640}, {"w": "buys", "f": 641, "e": 648}, {"w": "half", "f": 649, "e": 656}, {"w": "of", "f": 657, "e": 661}, {"w": "it", "f": 661, "e": 666}, {"w": "for", "f": 666, "e": 672}, {"w": "seven", "f": 673, "e": 682}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 682, "e": 695}, {"w": "twelve", "f": 695, "e": 706}, {"w": "thousand", "f": 706, "e": 720}, {"w": "dollars.", "f": 721, "e": 735}]}, {"a": 742, "b": 810, "text": "About a fifth of the fund, in one stock.", "words": [{"w": "About", "f": 744, "e": 752}, {"w": "a", "f": 753, "e": 755}, {"w": "fifth", "f": 756, "e": 764}, {"w": "of", "f": 764, "e": 768}, {"w": "the", "f": 769, "e": 774}, {"w": "fund,", "f": 774, "e": 782}, {"w": "in", "f": 783, "e": 787}, {"w": "one", "f": 787, "e": 792}, {"w": "stock.", "f": 793, "e": 802}]}, {"a": 810, "b": 889, "text": "Why would Wall Street's most careful man do that?", "words": [{"w": "Why", "f": 812, "e": 817}, {"w": "would", "f": 817, "e": 825}, {"w": "Wall", "f": 826, "e": 832}, {"w": "Street's", "f": 833, "e": 845}, {"w": "most", "f": 845, "e": 852}, {"w": "careful", "f": 852, "e": 863}, {"w": "man", "f": 864, "e": 869}, {"w": "do", "f": 869, "e": 873}, {"w": "that?", "f": 873, "e": 881}]}, {"a": 889, "b": 1028, "text": "You see, it's a lemonade stand with no middleman. Cheaper cups, longer line.", "words": [{"w": "You", "f": 891, "e": 897}, {"w": "see,", "f": 897, "e": 905}, {"w": "it's", "f": 906, "e": 914}, {"w": "a", "f": 914, "e": 917}, {"w": "lemonade", "f": 918, "e": 933}, {"w": "stand", "f": 933, "e": 943}, {"w": "with", "f": 943, "e": 951}, {"w": "no", "f": 952, "e": 956}, {"w": "middleman.", "f": 957, "e": 975}, {"w": "Cheaper", "f": 976, "e": 989}, {"w": "cups,", "f": 989, "e": 999}, {"w": "longer", "f": 999, "e": 1011}, {"w": "line.", "f": 1011, "e": 1021}]}, {"a": 1028, "b": 1134, "text": "Cheaper policies, more drivers, and the company kept growing.", "words": [{"w": "Cheaper", "f": 1030, "e": 1042}, {"w": "policies,", "f": 1043, "e": 1058}, {"w": "more", "f": 1058, "e": 1066}, {"w": "drivers,", "f": 1066, "e": 1080}, {"w": "and", "f": 1080, "e": 1086}, {"w": "the", "f": 1087, "e": 1092}, {"w": "company", "f": 1093, "e": 1105}, {"w": "kept", "f": 1106, "e": 1113}, {"w": "growing.", "f": 1113, "e": 1127}]}, {"a": 1134, "b": 1277, "text": "By nineteen seventy-two, that stake was worth four hundred million dollars.", "words": [{"w": "By", "f": 1136, "e": 1141}, {"w": "nineteen", "f": 1141, "e": 1156}, {"w": "seventy-two,", "f": 1157, "e": 1178}, {"w": "that", "f": 1178, "e": 1186}, {"w": "stake", "f": 1187, "e": 1196}, {"w": "was", "f": 1197, "e": 1203}, {"w": "worth", "f": 1204, "e": 1213}, {"w": "four", "f": 1214, "e": 1222}, {"w": "hundred", "f": 1222, "e": 1235}, {"w": "million", "f": 1236, "e": 1249}, {"w": "dollars.", "f": 1249, "e": 1264}]}, {"a": 1277, "b": 1428, "text": "Graham wrote that one decision beat all his others, over twenty years, combined.", "words": [{"w": "Graham", "f": 1279, "e": 1290}, {"w": "wrote", "f": 1291, "e": 1300}, {"w": "that", "f": 1301, "e": 1308}, {"w": "one", "f": 1309, "e": 1315}, {"w": "decision", "f": 1315, "e": 1330}, {"w": "beat", "f": 1330, "e": 1338}, {"w": "all", "f": 1338, "e": 1344}, {"w": "his", "f": 1345, "e": 1351}, {"w": "others,", "f": 1351, "e": 1364}, {"w": "over", "f": 1364, "e": 1372}, {"w": "twenty", "f": 1373, "e": 1383}, {"w": "years,", "f": 1384, "e": 1395}, {"w": "combined.", "f": 1395, "e": 1411}]}, {"a": 1428, "b": 1597, "text": "One lucky break, or one supremely shrewd decision. Can we tell them apart?", "words": [{"w": "One", "f": 1430, "e": 1436}, {"w": "lucky", "f": 1437, "e": 1447}, {"w": "break,", "f": 1448, "e": 1460}, {"w": "or", "f": 1461, "e": 1466}, {"w": "one", "f": 1466, "e": 1473}, {"w": "supremely", "f": 1474, "e": 1491}, {"w": "shrewd", "f": 1492, "e": 1504}, {"w": "decision.", "f": 1505, "e": 1523}, {"w": "Can", "f": 1523, "e": 1530}, {"w": "we", "f": 1531, "e": 1536}, {"w": "tell", "f": 1536, "e": 1545}, {"w": "them", "f": 1545, "e": 1554}, {"w": "apart?", "f": 1554, "e": 1567}]}]}